      "created_at": "2015-01-30T22:28:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually, I think it does two things:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Reduces the number of tokens out (which can get pretty ridiculous)</li>\n<li>Reduces need to remember to remove -1 tokens, as there are fewer</li>\n</ol>\n&nbsp;\n<p>I honestly don't know the official reasons - those are just my observations.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
